    activity: "Read Ecclesiastes 4:9-12 and Psalm 127:1 and discuss the cord of three strands. In pairs, practise a short prayer for each other. Draft a simple plan for family devotion: time, place, reading, prayer, song. Pray together that God will build our homes.",
    takeHome: "Read Psalm 127, Ecclesiastes 4:7-12, Matthew 18:15-20 and Joshua 24:14-24. Write a household declaration of faith. Memorise Joshua 24:15.",
